# GrandpaNiu login protection rules
# Purpose: keep common account, passport and verification endpoints ahead of reject rules in the single fusion module.
# These rules are intentionally conservative. Add only stable core login domains here.
# Google login must use PROXY; direct routing can break Safari OAuth pages.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,passport.jd.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,login.taobao.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,login.tmall.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,account.xiaomi.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,passport.baidu.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,graph.qq.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,open.weixin.qq.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appleid.apple.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,accounts.google.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,google.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gstatic.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,login.live.com,DIRECT
